      hu: ["A Big Hole 200 m mély és 463 m széles.", "Lakossága kb. 225.000 (2011).", "A Kimberley Club 1881-ben alakult.", "A De Beers bánya évi 3000 kg gyémántot termelt.", "A város 1183 m tengerszint felett van.", "A pályaudvar 1896-ban nyílt meg."],
      ro: ["Big Hole: adâncime 200 m, lățime 463 m.", "Populație: 225.000 (2011).", "Kimberley Club fondat în 1881.", "Mina De Beers producea 3.000 kg de diamante anual.", "Altitudine: 1.183 m.", "Gara din Kimberley deschisă în 1896."],
      en: ["Big Hole depth: 200 m, width: 463 m.", "Population: 225,000 (2011 census).", "Kimberley Club founded in 1881.", "De Beers mine output: 3,000 kg diamonds per year.", "Elevation: 1,183 m above sea level.", "Kimberley railway station opened in 1896."],
