      en: ["Kariega was founded as Uitenhage in 1804.", "Volkswagen plant produces over 100,000 vehicles annually.", "The city has a population of about 150,000 (2011).", "Kariega Game Reserve covers 10,000 hectares.", "The city is 30 km north of Gqeberha.", "The plant has been operating since 1946."],
